{"id":"n55731-1-5","stage":2,"title":"매진 · 售罄","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55731-1-5-1","ko":"아, 보려던 영화 표가 이미 매진이 되었어.","zh":"啊，我想看的电影票已经卖光了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보려던","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；려던：表示过去正打算做的动作，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"표가","meaning":"票，券","explanation":"표：票，券；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표","audio":"/audio/40ec1a2864faf2b46f95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71353","senseId":"1","lemma":"표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이미","meaning":"已经","explanation":"이미：已经","readings":[{"term":"이미","audio":"/audio/1d333b8427106c200840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71159","senseId":"1","lemma":"이미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매진이","meaning":"售罄，脱销，卖光","explanation":"매진：售罄，脱销，卖光；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"매진","audio":"/audio/04173d6da3c22da97c14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55731","senseId":"1","lemma":"매진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었어.","meaning":"用完，没有","explanation":"되다：用完，没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"15","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"40ec1a2864faf2b4","term":"표","zh":"票，券","audio":"/audio/40ec1a2864faf2b46f95.mp3","entryId":"71353","definition":"证明具有某种权利的纸条。","pronunciation":["표"]},{"id":"1d333b8427106c20","term":"이미","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/1d333b8427106c200840.mp3","entryId":"71159","definition":"某事发生的时间比现在早地。","pronunciation":["이ː미"]},{"id":"04173d6da3c22da9","term":"매진","zh":"售罄，脱销，卖光","audio":"/audio/04173d6da3c22da97c14.mp3","entryId":"55731","definition":"商品或票等全部卖掉。","pronunciation":["매ː진"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"用完，没有","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某种事物不再发挥功能或寿命已尽。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/47a0203848b5ba82e78c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55731-1-5-2","ko":"정말? 그럼 우리 영화는 못 보는 거야?","zh":"真的吗？那我们就看不到那部电影了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화는","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보는","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea87bc8d527bc4955d82.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.528,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55731","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3547,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的吗？那我们就看不到那部电影了？","妈妈，帮我梳头吧。","啊，我想看的电影票已经卖光了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["真的吗？那我们就看不到那部电影了？","啊，我想看的电影票已经卖光了。","妈妈，帮我梳头吧。"],"answer":0}]}
